<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="container narrow page prose">
  <h1>Terms of service</h1>
  <p class="muted">Please read these terms carefully before using the platform.</p>
  <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
  <p>By using <%= settings.site_name %> you agree to these terms and to our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>2. Your responsibilities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Describe items accurately, including their condition and any expiry date.</li>
    <li>Only donate supplies that are clean, safe and in working order.</li>
    <li>Treat other members with respect. Harassment, spam and misleading posts are not allowed.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>3. Prohibited items</h2>
  <p>Some medical supplies are restricted. Do not list prescription medication, expired products, or anything that is illegal to give away where you live. You are responsible for following local regulations.</p>
  <h2>4. No medical advice</h2>
  <p><%= settings.site_name %> connects people; it does not inspect items or give medical advice. Ask a healthcare professional before using donated equipment.</p>
  <h2>5. Moderation</h2>
  <p>We may remove content or suspend accounts that break these terms. You can report a post, comment or member at any time.</p>
  <p class="muted small">Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
</div>
